# What the bench kit downloads, pinned: each file from its project's own site, with the SHA-256 that project
# publishes (Node: nodejs.org/dist/v<version>/SHASUMS256.txt; MinGit: the digest on the Git for Windows release;
# the Visual C++ runtime: the hash in the path of Microsoft's own download, where aka.ms/vs/17/release/vc_redist.<arch>.exe
# leads).
# One key=value per line, read by start-bench.ps1 and start-bench.sh alike.
# Node is 24.14.0, the version the reference numbers were measured with: in 24.22.2 the fetch the harness polls servers
# with throws setTypeOfService EINVAL from a socket callback on macOS, which ends the run and leaves its servers behind.
